            "fast (measured cost)":    {"toks": 5.6, "io_bound": True},
        },
        "note": "prefill 10.8 tok/s expert-major (E27); ~2.4 tok/s warm at 10GB (E30). "
                "60+ tok/s for this model needs a wider memory bus (Mac Studio class), not more software.",
